---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy | Dionysus Club" description="Dionysus Club privacy policy">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>
    <strong>Dionysus Club</strong> ("the app", "we") is a cocktail recipe and
    menu management web app. This policy explains what information we collect,
    how we use it, and the choices you have.
  </p>
  <p>
    <em>Last updated: 2026.10.02</em>
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Google account information.</strong> When you sign in with Google,
    we receive your name, email address, and profile picture. We do not request
    access to your Gmail, Google Drive, Calendar, Contacts, or any other Google
    service.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Content you create.</strong> Recipes, your bar's cocktail list,
    ingredients, notes, and menus you build.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Basic technical data.</strong> Standard server logs (such as IP
    address, browser type, and timestamps) and, if you use the installable PWA
    version, data stored locally on your device for offline use.
  </p>

  <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To sign you in and identify your account.</li>
    <li>To store and display your recipes, bar list, and menus.</li>
    <li>To operate, secure, and improve the app.</li>
    <li>To contact you about your account or important service changes.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not sell your personal information and do not use it for advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Shared menus</h2>
  <p>
    Menus can be shared with others through a link. Anyone with the link can
    view the menu's contents (the cocktails and details you chose to include).
    Your email address and the rest of your bar list are not shown on shared
    menus. You can stop sharing a menu at any time by deleting the
    menu.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Google user data</h2>
  <p>
    The app's use and transfer of information received from Google APIs adheres
    to the{" "}
    <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy">
      Google API Services User Data Policy
    </a>
    , including the Limited Use requirements. Google account data is used only
    to provide sign-in and your account profile, is not shared with third
    parties except as needed to run the service, and is never used for
    advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Sharing and service providers</h2>
  <p>
    We share data only with providers that help us run the app (for example
    hosting and database services: Kinde, Vercel, Railway, and where required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Data retention and deletion</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your data while your account is active. You can delete your recipes
    and menus in the app at any time. To delete your account and all associated
    data, use the delete-account option in settings or email us at the address
    below. We will delete your data within 30 days.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can also revoke the app's access to your Google account at any time at{" "}
    <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">
      myaccount.google.com/permissions
    </a>
    .
  </p>

  <h2>7. Security</h2>
  <p>
    We use reasonable technical measures, including encrypted connections
    (HTTPS), to protect your data. No system is perfectly secure, so we cannot
    guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live (including the EU/EEA under the GDPR), you may
    have the right to access, correct, export, or delete your personal data, and
    to object to or restrict certain processing. Contact us to exercise these
    rights.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Children</h2>
  <p>
    This app involves alcohol-related content and is intended for adults of
    legal drinking age in their country. It is not directed at children under
    16, and we do not knowingly collect their data.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above
    shows the latest version.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Adam Szi
    <br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:soulevans.dev@gmail.com">soulevans.dev@gmail.com</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
